  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 24032079872
    m_Localized: Card Phase
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 178848034816
    m_Localized: Dungeon Phase
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 361283481600
    m_Localized: Controls
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39357430657024
    m_Localized: Keyboard explanation
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39438632382464
    m_Localized: Controller explanation
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39132590796800
    m_Localized: "The game is divided into two main phases: \nfirst you build a dungeon
      together, then you fight your way through it. "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39206129528832
    m_Localized: "During the card phase, players take turns placing dungeon cards
      on the map. \nEach card adds rooms which are filled with <color=#CC3F64>Enemies,</color>
      <color=#DBB33B>Loot</color> and other things.\nYou can open up paths or sabotage
      your opponents, but only next to existing tiles!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39243207176192
    m_Localized: "Control your character through the created dungeon and prepare
      for the final duel.\nYou\u2019ll collect coins to improve your stats, defeat
      enemies, and search for powerful upgrades.\n"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 39289113833472
    m_Localized: "The larger the dungeon you built, the more time you\u2019ll have
      to explore. \nUse every second wisely because what you collect carries over
      into the next round!\nOnce the timer runs out, all players return to the card
      phase.\n\nAt the end, players face each other in a final duel.\nRemember: what
      you set up during the card phase can shape your chances in battle!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5105994273943552
    m_Localized: 'You can revisit this screen in the Tutorial.

      Hold LR or
      R to continue.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7630781244272640
    m_Localized: Have Fun
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7640591859740672
    m_Localized: Left Stick for Movement
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7640738702323712
    m_Localized: WASD for Movement
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7926432364523520
    m_Localized: 'Welcome to '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8738618322219008
    m_Localized: "In Dungeon Duell, your health bar is shared across two phases.\nDuring
      the card phase, you have your full health bar.\nIt represents your total condition
      and how much you\u2019ll carry into the dungeon phase."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 20686290497875968
    m_Localized: "At the start of the dungeon phase, you take exactly 100 health
      points with you.\nIf you lose any, they\u2019re  subtracted from your card
      phase health.\n\nIn the final duel, you use all remaining health directly in
      the dungeon.\nThe better you do, the more health you\u2019ll have when it matters
      most."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21360561588301824
    m_Localized: Healthbar
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
